# Visual polish sessions

- Only polish models that already PASS (1 section / 0 collisions).
- Allowed: colors, cutaway presentation, export naming, tile cosmetics that do not break clutch.
- Forbidden in the same session: reconnect order, spine-nuke, MST, staple flood, raising diameter.
- If a visual change breaks 1/0, revert it or open a separate gap-fill session — do not “fix connectivity later” in the polish chat.
- Exports live under `output/phase5/` (`sphere_full.io`, `sphere_half_cut.io`).
